WEBVTT

00:00:00.223 --> 00:00:07.094
Transcending the saddness
for the sake of tommorrow.

00:00:10.954 --> 00:00:12.408
-Candy, let's go!
-Okay!

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:25.493
-There's one hill I like, and it's this way.
-A hill?

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:30.257
Look out!

00:00:57.009 --> 00:01:02.315
Anthony!

00:01:21.972 --> 00:01:23.584
Anthony, hang in there!

00:01:24.198 --> 00:01:25.442
Anthony!

00:01:27.518 --> 00:01:29.688
But Anthony did not answer.

00:01:30.489 --> 00:01:33.019
She called and called,
yet he did not answer.

00:02:12.942 --> 00:02:13.859
Anthony!

00:02:14.879 --> 00:02:15.837
Miss Candy!

00:02:16.084 --> 00:02:18.061
Miss Candy! Miss Candy!

00:02:18.984 --> 00:02:19.588
Dorothy?

00:02:19.785 --> 00:02:21.725
Miss Candy is... Miss Candy is...!

00:02:23.173 --> 00:02:24.576
She woke up?
Candy!

00:02:26.735 --> 00:02:27.693
Candy!

00:02:29.862 --> 00:02:31.530
Stear, Archie...

00:02:33.117 --> 00:02:34.154
Anthony?

00:02:34.535 --> 00:02:35.746
Where is he?

00:02:38.282 --> 00:02:39.993
Where is Anthony?

00:02:48.587 --> 00:02:49.614
He's dead?

00:02:50.391 --> 00:02:54.963
He hit his head against the ground.
We ran to help him but...

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:55.983
You're lying!

00:02:56.365 --> 00:02:58.562
You're lying that Anthony died!

00:02:58.709 --> 00:03:00.162
...that he died...

00:03:01.042 --> 00:03:01.809
If only it were a lie!

00:03:02.011 --> 00:03:04.811
He was all well and joking this morning,
and he's suddenly gone by the evening...

00:03:04.812 --> 00:03:07.488
...it's such a bad joke!
Right, Archie?

00:03:08.252 --> 00:03:12.464
Why did he have to die?
He was such a good guy... why did he die?

00:03:13.448 --> 00:03:15.470
He's dead.
Anthony is dead.

00:03:18.832 --> 00:03:19.977
Candy?

00:03:23.186 --> 00:03:25.287
Now, let's go, Candy!

00:03:31.981 --> 00:03:35.505
To attend such a wonderful party...!

00:03:40.607 --> 00:03:42.285
Go, Anthony!

00:03:45.708 --> 00:03:47.399
Mr. Anthony!

00:03:50.253 --> 00:03:54.690
Candy... you still haven't
forgotten about your prince?

00:03:57.080 --> 00:04:01.086
Was it... because I look a bit like him?

00:04:01.949 --> 00:04:04.569
Anthony!
That's not true!

00:04:04.604 --> 00:04:08.371
I don't care who the Prince is!
Anthony, it's because...

00:04:10.869 --> 00:04:13.563
...because...
I like you.

00:04:34.163 --> 00:04:35.461
It's a bell...

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:40.072
Dorothy, that bell...

00:04:43.505 --> 00:04:45.474
You look so sad.

00:04:45.908 --> 00:04:47.372
It's mr. Anthony's...

00:04:58.463 --> 00:04:59.714
I have to go!

00:05:00.138 --> 00:05:03.126
You mustn't!
You can't go out with this fever!

00:05:03.127 --> 00:05:04.942
Please, let me go!

00:05:04.996 --> 00:05:08.485
Don't be unreasonable! You haven't
eaten anything in two days!

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:10.475
Doctor will scold you!

00:05:16.731 --> 00:05:17.930
Anthony?

00:05:19.999 --> 00:05:21.187
Doctor!

00:05:22.021 --> 00:05:23.638
Now, now, go back to your bed.

00:05:32.573 --> 00:05:35.572
Our Father, who are in heaven...

00:05:35.607 --> 00:05:44.616
...accept the soul of your humble
servant, Anthony Brown Adley,

00:05:44.651 --> 00:05:48.702
...and let it rest in peace.

00:05:53.448 --> 00:05:54.831
Amen.

00:06:28.524 --> 00:06:32.308
All roses have died during the night.
Yet they were beautiful while they bloomed.

00:06:32.493 --> 00:06:35.393
It's almost as if
rose petals turned into tears.

00:06:35.428 --> 00:06:38.249
Come to think of it, the garden looks
as if it were tired from crying.

00:06:42.817 --> 00:06:44.379
It's not only the rose bushes!

00:06:44.587 --> 00:06:47.456
The entire Adley family is mourning the loss.

00:06:53.146 --> 00:06:58.440
Aunt Elroy used to be so loud. Now she has
withdrawn into herself completely.

00:07:01.634 --> 00:07:06.588
And Candy, who used to be so cheerful,
has now locked herself up in her room.

00:07:25.662 --> 00:07:28.259
It's as if the whole place died.

00:07:28.321 --> 00:07:32.450
Come to think of it, you haven't invented
anything unusual in a long time!

00:07:32.908 --> 00:07:33.943
Maybe you're right!

00:07:33.978 --> 00:07:38.066
Brother, at times like this, you've got to
build something crazy to cheer up everyone!

00:07:38.662 --> 00:07:39.436
Alright!

00:07:49.388 --> 00:07:50.359
Come in.

00:07:56.496 --> 00:07:57.708
Hello, Candy!

00:08:01.403 --> 00:08:02.129
A rabbit?

00:08:13.042 --> 00:08:13.916
Anthony.

00:08:20.995 --> 00:08:21.840
Candy?

00:08:23.805 --> 00:08:24.892
I'm sorry.

00:08:24.927 --> 00:08:27.311
I remembered Anthony when I saw the rabbit.

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:28.949
A rabbit?

00:08:28.984 --> 00:08:31.979
Uh, Candy...
It's supposed to be a squirrel...

00:08:33.472 --> 00:08:34.542
So it's a squirrel?

00:08:35.757 --> 00:08:37.010
Candy laughed!

00:08:37.756 --> 00:08:38.976
Candy really...

00:08:40.118 --> 00:08:42.842
Thank you, Stear and Archie.
You did this for me...

00:08:45.122 --> 00:08:46.724
I won't cry anymore.

00:08:47.005 --> 00:08:48.060
-That's great!
-Yeah.

00:08:48.095 --> 00:08:49.200
Miss Candy!

00:08:49.517 --> 00:08:50.482
Has something happened?

00:08:50.881 --> 00:08:53.602
There is... there is somebody
in mr. Anthony's room!

00:08:53.637 --> 00:08:55.080
-In Anthony's room?
-Yes!

00:09:06.677 --> 00:09:07.569
It's Anthony!

00:09:07.629 --> 00:09:08.703
Bro!

00:09:08.898 --> 00:09:09.996
Anthony?!

00:09:17.347 --> 00:09:18.607
Anthony...?

00:09:22.262 --> 00:09:23.209
Anthony!

00:09:27.732 --> 00:09:28.566
Neil?

00:09:29.184 --> 00:09:29.989
Hi.

00:09:30.437 --> 00:09:33.654
-What are you doing, Neil?
-Aren't those Anthony's clothes?

00:09:34.039 --> 00:09:36.867
Lookin' good, right?
But it's nothing special.

00:09:38.166 --> 00:09:41.273
Hey Neil, since when did you become
a petty thief?

00:09:41.313 --> 00:09:44.769
Let go!
I have Aunt's permission!

00:09:45.414 --> 00:09:46.639
Aunt?

00:09:46.966 --> 00:09:52.327
That's right. Aunt said that
I can take Anthony's things.

00:09:52.705 --> 00:09:53.880
Aunt said...

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:58.683
Now, take it please.
Put it in here.

00:10:02.874 --> 00:10:04.304
Anthony's roses...!

00:10:05.349 --> 00:10:07.452
I'll take them. I will be the only one...

00:10:07.453 --> 00:10:09.958
...who will continue to care after roses
of my beloved Anthony!

00:10:10.025 --> 00:10:13.326
Anthony's roses are beautiful
because they grow in this garden!

00:10:13.426 --> 00:10:15.851
Shut up! You murdered Anthony!

00:10:16.459 --> 00:10:17.303
Eliza!

00:10:17.478 --> 00:10:20.063
If you two hadn't separated from the rest
during the fox hunt,

00:10:20.098 --> 00:10:22.628
...such a thing would have never
happened to Anthony!

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:26.747
If I were riding with him, I wouldn't
have allowed him to come in such danger.

00:10:27.256 --> 00:10:29.491
Hoittman! Get to work!

00:10:30.016 --> 00:10:31.268
Yes, miss.

00:10:32.603 --> 00:10:35.601
Eliza, please! Don't take Anthony's roses!

00:10:36.163 --> 00:10:39.407
I got permission from Aunt Elroy.

00:10:41.047 --> 00:10:43.839
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
;__;

00:10:44.487 --> 00:10:48.203
Anthony worked so hard to foster those roses!

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:54.139
Candy, I'm trying for forget about Anthony.
I want to forget everything.

00:10:54.528 --> 00:10:56.639
And that's why you're giving roses away?

00:10:56.670 --> 00:11:01.030
If I let them be, they will bloom again
and remember me of him.

00:11:01.065 --> 00:11:02.009
I don't want that!

00:11:02.183 --> 00:11:03.097
Candy?

00:11:03.272 --> 00:11:05.928
I don't want to forget about Anthony!

00:11:05.963 --> 00:11:08.758
Candy, are you questioning my decisions?

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:09.609
Yes!

00:11:11.574 --> 00:11:13.849
I support Candy's idea!

00:11:15.255 --> 00:11:16.130
Me too.

00:11:17.324 --> 00:11:18.659
Why did you two...

00:11:19.435 --> 00:11:24.250
Anthony cared so much about that rose garden
because it reminded him of his late mother.

00:11:24.412 --> 00:11:29.423
Now that Anthony is gone, we must continue
to take care of it!

00:11:30.491 --> 00:11:35.066
I won't allow it. You don't get to
decide on such family matters.

00:11:35.571 --> 00:11:38.918
Hoittman, hurry up.
Take this bush now.

00:11:41.128 --> 00:11:46.248
If I can say something, these withered
flowers won't look good in your garden...

00:11:46.424 --> 00:11:48.656
How can you tell, if you don't plant them?

00:11:48.841 --> 00:11:52.054
But now that all the flowers
have withered away...

00:11:52.089 --> 00:11:54.372
Okay? Just do what I tell you!

00:11:54.724 --> 00:11:55.672
Candy!

00:11:57.839 --> 00:12:00.688
Eliza! Return all roses to the ground!

00:12:00.689 --> 00:12:01.581
What?

00:12:01.815 --> 00:12:03.658
These roses belong to Anthony!

00:12:03.829 --> 00:12:05.209
But Anthony is...

00:12:05.623 --> 00:12:08.371
Anthony is living in this rose garden!

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:14.031
When spring comes, and roses blossom again,
I'm sure that Anthony will come back too.

00:12:14.353 --> 00:12:16.234
This garden is his life now.

00:12:16.839 --> 00:12:18.421
Close your eyes and look well...

00:12:18.775 --> 00:12:20.740
Can you see him?

00:12:34.599 --> 00:12:37.593
I can see mr. Anthony, too...

00:13:02.467 --> 00:13:04.916
Hoittman? What's the meaning of this?

00:13:05.525 --> 00:13:08.821
The soul of mr. Anthony resides in these roses!

00:13:08.856 --> 00:13:11.124
Didn't you hear what I just said?

00:13:11.908 --> 00:13:19.653
I did. I've been minding Leagan's gardens for
thirty years, but I've never once defied you.

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:22.029
Aren't you doing that right now?

00:13:22.242 --> 00:13:26.645
Yes. I can betray you, miss, but now that God
called mr. Anthony to his side,

00:13:26.646 --> 00:13:28.737
...how could I ever betray him?

00:13:28.924 --> 00:13:30.369
Mr. Hoittman!

00:13:30.776 --> 00:13:36.732
Mr. Anthony may be gone, but he's still
living in hearts of every one of us!

00:13:50.206 --> 00:13:53.037
-I can see him.
-I see him too!

00:13:53.249 --> 00:13:56.885
-Mr. Anthony! Mr. Anthony!
-Stop that!

00:13:57.227 --> 00:14:02.470
That's enough! It was Aunt Elroy's decision!
Now, hurry and take these roses!

00:14:08.566 --> 00:14:09.772
Are you deaf?

00:14:09.967 --> 00:14:11.981
Aunt Elroy ordered this!

00:14:18.251 --> 00:14:22.296
All of you will be fired!
These are Aunt Elroy's orders!

00:14:27.029 --> 00:14:30.499
You'll be fired! All of you!
You're defying Aunt's orders!

00:14:30.534 --> 00:14:36.375
Eliza! Why do you want these roses so much?
It would be better if you took those white bushes.

00:14:36.556 --> 00:14:39.426
Are you saying that I should
be satisfied with that?

00:14:39.461 --> 00:14:42.607
Anthony grew these roses from dirt
using his bare hands!

00:14:42.642 --> 00:14:47.306
That's right! Every day, mr. Anthony
would get up early in the morning for this!

00:14:50.812 --> 00:14:54.970
I'll remember this! I'll tell aunt Elroy,
and she'll fire every single one of you!

00:14:57.412 --> 00:14:58.692
Anthony...

00:15:28.755 --> 00:15:31.734
Anthony... what should I do?

00:15:32.492 --> 00:15:35.213
The only thing I have here
is the memory of you.

00:15:35.663 --> 00:15:37.275
I can't do anything.

00:15:49.683 --> 00:15:51.322
Candy!

00:15:52.343 --> 00:15:54.512
Candy, where are you?

00:15:55.573 --> 00:15:57.254
Candy!

00:15:59.286 --> 00:16:01.225
-Candy!
-That's...

00:16:01.464 --> 00:16:02.462
That's Annie's voice!

00:16:05.528 --> 00:16:08.512
-Kurin, long time no see!
-Annie!

00:16:09.778 --> 00:16:10.776
Candy!

00:16:13.934 --> 00:16:15.713
Annie, how come you're here?

00:16:15.905 --> 00:16:20.073
I heard that you shut yourself into
your room when Anthony died.

00:16:20.454 --> 00:16:25.082
I worried so much about you, until I got
permission from Father to visit you.

00:16:25.278 --> 00:16:27.830
Now it's my turn to console you!

00:16:28.433 --> 00:16:31.342
But Annie, how did you find me here?

00:16:31.938 --> 00:16:37.452
Mr. Hoittman said that I'll probably
find you around here.

00:16:37.634 --> 00:16:39.432
I see, it was mr. Hoittman...

00:16:40.491 --> 00:16:44.499
Candy, it's my turn to give you strength!
Cheer up!

00:16:44.852 --> 00:16:46.461
Thank you, Annie.

00:16:51.271 --> 00:16:54.067
But I'm glad to have found you so well.

00:16:54.102 --> 00:16:57.854
Candy, quickly return into your old,
cheerful self!

00:16:58.029 --> 00:17:02.768
I'm okay now.
I'll start anew once I leave this place.

00:17:02.963 --> 00:17:06.002
There are too many memories
of Anthony in this place.

00:17:06.037 --> 00:17:10.478
That might be for the best. You quickly
recovered from sadness in only one day...

00:17:11.143 --> 00:17:14.265
Hey, I wonder what are everybody doing
at Pony's home now!

00:17:14.464 --> 00:17:17.929
Are they making dolls or necklaces
from fallen leaves?

00:17:18.028 --> 00:17:20.497
That's right... Pony's home.

00:17:21.183 --> 00:17:24.709
If I climb that big tree, I could
scream at the top of my lungs,

00:17:24.744 --> 00:17:30.078
sending all the sadness away from me,
and bidding my farewell to Anthony.

00:17:33.287 --> 00:17:34.804
Huh? That rose...

00:17:37.866 --> 00:17:40.357
It's blooming! Sweet Candy!

00:17:42.113 --> 00:17:44.663
Others have all withered away,
but this one remained.

00:17:44.837 --> 00:17:47.637
Anthony bestowed it with my name.

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:52.050
It's a new kind of rose I made!
Its name is "Sweet Candy."

00:17:52.648 --> 00:17:53.936
Anthony...

00:17:53.971 --> 00:17:55.997
That's right, it does look a bit like you!

00:17:56.148 --> 00:17:58.792
It's the only one with enough
strength to bloom here.

00:17:59.578 --> 00:18:03.212
-Annie, I'm not giving up.
-Candy!

00:18:08.430 --> 00:18:09.892
I'd like to see it.

00:18:11.896 --> 00:18:15.920
Because you have so many
memories of that place!

00:18:15.955 --> 00:18:16.650
...yeah.

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:18.150
Let's go there together!

00:18:18.935 --> 00:18:19.814
Really?

00:18:20.123 --> 00:18:22.001
I want to see the place where you grew up.

00:18:22.201 --> 00:18:23.131
It's a promise!

00:18:23.497 --> 00:18:24.327
It's a promise.

00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:28.736
Let's go, Anthony!
To Pony's hill.

00:18:32.466 --> 00:18:34.718
Mr. Stear! Mr. Archie!

00:18:36.729 --> 00:18:38.517
-What's the matter, Dorothy?
-Read this!

00:18:43.624 --> 00:18:47.205
Stear, Archie,
I'm going to strike out on my own.

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:53.898
Please, forgive me for leaving without seeing
you, but it would've been too painful that way.

00:18:53.899 --> 00:18:55.847
Candy will never forget just
how gentle you were to her!

00:18:55.882 --> 00:18:59.665
I'd like to thank grandfather William
for adopting me as his daughter.

00:19:00.978 --> 00:19:03.501
Please send my best regards to Aunt.

00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:05.713
Farewell, Candy.

00:19:10.614 --> 00:19:13.511
-Brother, let's go after her!
-But how?

00:19:28.556 --> 00:19:30.674
We're almost there, Anthony.

00:19:32.955 --> 00:19:35.771
Pony's home...
We're home, Anthony!

00:19:36.638 --> 00:19:39.280
This is my strong father tree...

00:19:40.872 --> 00:19:44.891
...and that's the hill where I met the Prince.
It hasn't changed at all!

00:19:45.223 --> 00:19:49.650
And finally, this is Pony's home, with gentle,
mother-like sister Pony and sister Lane.

00:19:52.603 --> 00:19:56.512
-It's Candy!
-Candy came back!

00:20:01.406 --> 00:20:02.263
Candy!

00:20:06.948 --> 00:20:08.504
I'm home, everybody!

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:15.138
Candy is back!

00:20:16.048 --> 00:20:19.012
Anthony, I came home, too.

00:20:19.922 --> 00:20:22.411
Just like you returned to your mother...

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:25.957
...I returned to Pony's home.

00:20:30.736 --> 00:20:34.881
Candy came back to Pony's home,
a place she calls her homeland.

00:20:35.091 --> 00:20:41.869
And at the top of Pony's hill, she planted
Sweet Candy which remained after Anthony.

00:20:47.119 --> 00:20:50.267
To be continued.
